    schema:description """This Body Corporate Indigenous Land Use Agreement was entered between the following parties:

- Mr Kenneth Eric Vonhoff and Ms Wendy Annette Scott
- Kalkadoon Native Title Aboriginal Corporation RNTBC
- State of Queensland

The purpose of the ILUA is to Surrender to the state all native title in the Surrender Area described as Lot 1 on AP11627 near the Mount Isa region."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:c74e76ef-701f-5784-8223-5fcd87a7641c,
