    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=6223> ;
    schema:name "Kalkadoon People, Vonhoff and Scott, and State of Queensland Surrender Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA)"@en ;
    schema:startDate "2013-03-19"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Details of the agreement

Through this agreement all native title claims will be surrendered.

Commencement
This agreement commences on the execution date.

Native title in the ILUA Area
Non exclusive native title rights existed in relation to the land and waters within the agreement area."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www.nntt.gov.au/Indigenous-Land-Use-Agreements/Search-Registered-ILUAs/ILUA%20Register/2013/QI2013.006/ILUARegisterExport.pdf"^^xsd:anyURI .

