    schema:description "The water pipeline Deed of Agreement was made between the Koonibba Aboriginal Community Council, the Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Commission and the District Council of Ceduna in order to construct a pipeline to improve the supply of water for the Koonibba Community."@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:8afa6040-57f6-5faf-a4f9-863bd8f4f470,
