        atns-sub:ffe61b3b-8b29-5264-89ac-758a03928ea5,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:location "Ceduna, South Australia, Australia"@en ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=502> ;
    schema:name "Koonibba Community Pipeline Deed of Agreement"@en ;
    schema:startDate "1996-10-01"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Benefits from the agreement have been improvements in the supply of quality and quantity of water to the community and employment for local Aboriginal people.

The Ceduna Koonibba Water Authority was established by the District Council of Ceduna in order to operate and maintain the $5 million water scheme. The Authority includes representatives from the Koonibba Aboriginal Community Council."""@en .

