    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description "The Alcan South Pacific Agreement was signed by Alcan Aluminium and the Mapoon and Napranum communities in Cape York. The agreement endorses the procedure of an (AUD) $200 million Ely bauxite mine, and includes provision for employment, training and local investment."@en ;
