    schema:text "The ILUA was modified following the annual general meeting of the Antakirinja Land Management Aboriginal Corporation (ALMAC), at which it was decided that some of the overlapping native title groups in the area would be absorbed into the larger Antakirinja native title claim. The Agreement now reflects the current native title claims in the ILUA area."@en .

