    schema:description """Project: Rio Tinto Exploration
Summary: The Mt Lean Agreement is a comprehensive conjunctive exploration agreement providing for exploration access on Aboriginal freehold land. The Agreement includes provision for a liaison structure, heritage & cultural protection, community benefits, training, employment, and also provision for land rents, profit interest and regional development if mineral discovery and mine development occurs."""@en ;
