    schema:description """The Mount Saunders Agreement was made between Traditional Owners, Telstra and Nabalco for the construction of an underground cable system to facilities on Mount Saunders in the Northern Territory.
The Agreement follows 18 months of negotiations between the parties, after Telstra and Nabalco rejected a compromise offer put forward by the Traditional Owners."""@en ;
