    schema:description """The Mental Health Care Agreement between Bundaberg Health Service and Bundaberg-Burnett Community Development Employment Program (CDEP) was signed on 10 March 2005.

Under the agreement, local people will have access to training to become ‘Indigenous cultural liasons persons.’ This is aimed at encouraging more Indigenous persons to seek mental health care."""@en ;
