    schema:description """Project: Rio Tinto Exploration
Summary: Native Title Memorandum of Understanding which outlines the procedure for the preservation of native title rights during exploration and mining on a Pastoral Lease and vacant Crown Land. Includes sacred site/heritage protection, liaison, work program clearances, environmental protection and rehabilitation, employment and training, and a commitment to negotiate a mining agreement in good faith."""@en ;
