    schema:description "The Alice Springs to Darwin Corridor Agreement was made between the Larrakia and the Northern Territory Government. The Larrakia agreed to relinquish their native title rights in the corridor in exchange for land, including a one-hectare block at Bullocky Point. An (AUD) $6 million dollar cultural centre will be constructed on the site to showcase Larrakia history, culture and attachment to their traditional land."@en ;
