    schema:description """Ilfracombe Shire Council (Unreported, FCA, 20 June 2002, Drummond J)

The Federal Court made a determination in respect of a consent non-claimant application which was brought by Ilfracombe Shire Council as Trustee for the area. The determination was that native title did not exist in relation to specific lots within a reserve for the purpose of pasturage at Ilfracombe in Central Queensland that were required for future public works. The non-claimant application was over a wider area than the area of the determination and was dismissed by the Federal Court except for the area of the determination."""@en ;
