    schema:description "The Kalkadoon / Mt Isa Northridge Industrial Estate Indigenous Land Use Agreement allows for Unallocated State Land (USL) to be transferred into freehold title for reserves to be created in the Mount Isa Industrial Estate. The Indigenous people of the area, the Kalkadoon People, have agreed to surrender all native title rights and interests that may exist in the area of the ILUA to the State."@en ;
