    schema:description "The Memorandum of Understanding between the Miwatj Regional Council, the Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Commission (ATSIC), the Northern Territory Department of Employment, Education and Training (DEET), Centrelink, the Commonwealth Department of Employment and Workplace Relations (DEWR) and the Commonwealth Department of Education, Science and Training (DEST) ('the MOU') was signed in Nhulunbuy on 19 April 2002. The agreement aims to enhance learning and training outcomes for Yolngu people."@en ;
