    schema:startDate "2004-07-23"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Purpose

The current cultural centre will be renovated to create a women's centre that promotes women's culture in Mulan.

Shared Responsibilities

The Commonwealth Government contribution to this SRA is $6000."""@en .

