    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description "The Wyamba Aboriginal Corporation & Middalya Pastoral Lease Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA) was agreed between the Wyamba Aboriginal Corporation and pastoralist Three Corners Properties Pty Ltd for the period commencing on 15 January 2010. The purpose of the ILUA is to allow the grant of a pastoral lease over the ILUA area, and also to provide consent for a range of future acts with respect to this area."@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:29221ef9-81d0-59aa-a9c9-744b71ff8349,
