    schema:additionalType cat-obj-types:Agreement ;
    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description """This ILUA is between Jubilee Downs Pastoral Co Pty Ltd and the Bunuba Dawangarri Aboriginal Corporation Registered Native Title Body Corporate (RNTBC).

The purpose of the ILUA is to provide consent for access to the pastoral lease area.

The ILUA area covers 53.6 sq km, approximately 35 km northwest of Fitzroy Crossing Townsite.

The Native Title Registered Body for this area is the Kimberley Land Council Aboriginal Corporation."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:9335b2f1-4915-55cc-9736-2ded7c4a2008,
        atns-sub:bda82010-54a4-5bac-8bf5-4b5341822974,
