    schema:description "FreightLink is offering one $5000 scholarship to a student from the Central Land Council area and one from the Northern Land Council Region each year for the next ten years. The scholarships are being offered as a spinoff from the Alice to Darwin railway project as a way of recognising the Indigenous contribution to the railway and of building skills and professional talent in the Northern Territory's Indigenous community."@en ;
