    schema:description """The Yandruwandha/Yawarrawarrka Bollards Lagoon Pastoral Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA) was agreed between the State of South Australia (APPLICANT) and Grant Richard Rieck; Charlie Moore, Leslie Harris, Fay Nicholls, Theresa Bottrell, Aaron Peterson, Anita Paterson and Fedrick Brown on behalf of the Yandruwandha/Yawarrawarrka People; and the Yandruwandha/Yawarrawarrka Traditional Land Owners (Aboriginal Corporation) on 7 March 2008.

The purpose of the ILUA is to provide, amongst other things, for the Yandruwandha/Yawarrawarrka People accessing and undertaking traditional activities in the area covered by the ILUA.

The ILUA was registered on 7 March 2008 and does not have a stipulated period of operation."""@en ;
