    schema:description """Kaurareg People v State of Queensland [2001] FCA 657 (23 May 2001) QG 6027

Number 5 of 5 Kaurareg Native Title Consent Determinations.
Between: Mr Billy Wasaga and Others on behalf of the Kaurareg People (APPLICANTS) AND
State of Queensland, Douglas D Nutley, Geoffrey Donald McKenzie, Michael J Clinch, Norman A Clinch, Thomas V Lee and Doretta Hewlett, Torres Shire Council, Torres Strait Regional Authority.

Judge: Justice Drummond
Where: Brisbane

Determination:
Native title exists in the determination area except those parts described in Order 2 where native title rights have been wholly extinguished

The determination area comprises land and inland waters of Mipa (Pipa Islet and Turtle Island), Tarilag (Packe Island), Yeta (Port Lihou Islands) and Damaralag (Dumuralug Islet) Torres Strait, Queensland."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
