    atns:subcategory atns-subcat:09f0a068-ce65-5c11-8dec-f081d1a81ec2 ;
    schema:additionalType cat-obj-types:Agreement ;
    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description """Wangkangurru Yarluyandi Pastoral Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA) is a Body Corporate Agreement between:

- The Attorney-General on behalf of the State of South Australia;

- David Brook and Broschul Pty Ltd ACN 81866042; and

- Wangkangurru Yarluyandi Aboriginal Corporation.

The purpose of the Agreement is to provide for the doing of certain Future Acts within the Agreement Area."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:9335b2f1-4915-55cc-9736-2ded7c4a2008,
        atns-sub:b9cb4d2e-5a5b-57ae-a2ac-5450c37a61d8,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=6724> ;
    schema:name "Wangkangurru Yarluyandi Alton Downs Pastoral Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA)"@en ;
    schema:spatialCoverage <https://data.idnau.org/pid/nntt/SI2014-015> ;
    schema:startDate "2015-01-13"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Commencement

This ILUA was registered with the Register of Indigenous Land Use Agreements on 13 January 2015.

The Extract does not provide a specific start or end date for the Agreement.

However, the Extract notes that the Agreement commences on the Commencement Date and continues indefinitely unless it is terminated or deregistered.

The Commencement Date is defined as the date on which the Agreement is registered and entered on the register, being 13 January 2015.

Native Title Provisions

The Extract notes that the Agreement includes no statements mentioned in subsection 24EB(1) or 24EBA(1) or (4) of the Native Title Act.

Native Title in the ILUA Area

The Agreement Area includes the Consent Determination of the Federal Court of Australia made in favour of the Wangkangurru Yarluyandi People in relation to the Wangkangurru Yarluyandi
Native Tittle Claim on 3 October 2014."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www.nntt.gov.au/searchRegApps/NativeTitleRegisters/Pages/ILUA_details.aspx?NNTT_Fileno=SI2014/015"^^xsd:anyURI .

