    schema:description """Project: Yandicoogina Iron Ore Project
Summary: The Yandicoogina Negotiations Protocol and Confidentiality Deed sets out the protocols and describes the principles and procedures that governed negotiations with Gumala Aboriginal Corporation regarding Hamersley Iron's proposals for an iron ore mine and railway extension at Yandicoogina. Negotiations were conducted in the form of 'mediation' under an appointed mediator. The objective was to explore ways to achieve long term benefits and security to both parties."""@en ;
