        atns-sub:dbff1607-a2a3-5baf-995d-8c9bb0552665,
        atns-sub:ef36130b-f525-5200-b398-93681fdc865b,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:location "Etheridge Shire, Queensland, Australia"@en ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=1952> ;
    schema:name "Ewamian - Etheridge Townships Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA)"@en ;
    schema:startDate "2004-03-12"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """The Ewamian people have secured access to three reserves: Einasleigh, Forsayth and Mt Surprise. They have also secured land and housing in Georgetown.

The Ewamian people have surrendered native title rights over the townships of Einasleigh, Forsayth and Mt Surprise and Georgetown."""@en .

