    schema:description "The Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) was entered into by the City of Geraldton, Greenough Shire and the local Aboriginal communities. The MOU provides a framework for partnership by acknowledging the contribution and history of Indigenous peoples. Specifically, the Geraldton and Greenough Councils commit to promoting and supporting Aboriginal events, celebrations and culture. The MOU commits the parties to encouraging participation and to promoting Aboriginal employment."@en ;
