        "Demo" ;
    schema:location "Wadeye, Northern Territory, Australia"@en ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=3291> ;
    schema:name "Wadeye \\\"Planning for Better Education\\\" Shared Responsibility Agreement (SRA)"@en ;
    schema:startDate "2005-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Purpose

This SRA provides funding for the community to run a series of workshops on education and education planning in language, through which the community will decide on a model to establish their own education board.

Shared Responsibilities

The community will participate in this series of workshops and will decide on the model for their education board.

The Commonwealth government will provide funding to run the workshops, and will employ a qualified interpreter."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www.indigenous.gov.au/sra/nt/fact_sheets/ntnov0508.pdf"^^xsd:anyURI .

