The Thalanyji and Yanrey Pastoral ILUA was agreed between Kimberley Thomas de Pledge (the pastoral lessee of Yanrey Station) and Buurabalyji Thalanyji Aboriginal Corporation (on behalf of the Thalanyji People).

The purpose of the ILUA is to provide consent for the doing of the following future acts:
