    schema:description """Between: William Doyle, Doug Bruce, Sonny Condren, Connie Craigie, Noelene Dempsey, Patricia Kyle, Hazel Munro, Ilona Parter and Sue Samardin Jr on behalf of the Kalkadoon People # 4 (APPLICANTS) and

