    schema:description "This ILUA concerns a number of future acts in relation to a mining project in northern Queensland. It was negotiated between the Bar-Barrum Native Title Parties, the Jirrbal Native Title Parties, the Bar-Barrum Aboriginal Corporation, North Queensland Metals Pty Ltd, Walker Resources Pty Ltd and Dianne Mining Corporation Pty Ltd."@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
