    schema:description """The Memorandum of Understanding between the Ashburton Aboriginal Corporation and the Shire of Ashburton (the MOU) provides for a number of outcomes, including:
• a cooperative approach to recycling;
• project work;
• direct Indigenous employment at the Shire; and,
• the hosting of potential Indigenous employees for three months (see DIOR 2008: 3; Shire of Ashburton 2006: 14).

The Shire of Ashburton resolved to enter the MOU in May 2006 (Shire of Ashburton 2006)."""@en ;
