    schema:description """This ILUA 'relates to the grant and use of Victorian Mining Licenses 5414 & 5415 and the conduct of cultural heritage management procedures'.

The ILUA provides that the parties agree the right to negotiate provisions of the Native Title Act 1993 (Cth) do not apply to the License.

The parties agree to the grant by the State of the Licenses and any consents required by or on behalf of the proponenent pursuant to the Licenses in respect of the License areas."""@en ;
