    schema:description """The native title claims of the Martidja Banyjima people and the Eastern Guruma people overlapped, preventing negotiations progressing toward a consent determination.

The Martidja Banyjima people signed an in-principle agreement to withdraw the boundary of their claim so that it did not overlap with the boundary of the Eastern Guruma people's claim."""@en ;
