    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description """The Yeeda Station and Nyikina Mangala Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA) is a Body Corporate Agreement entered into by:

- Yeeda Pastoral Company Pty Ltd; and

- Walalakoo Aboriginal Corporation.

The Extract fails to outline with any specificity the purpose of the agreement."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:9335b2f1-4915-55cc-9736-2ded7c4a2008,
        atns-sub:bda82010-54a4-5bac-8bf5-4b5341822974,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=6619> ;
    schema:name "Yeeda Station and Nyikina Mangala Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA)"@en ;
    schema:spatialCoverage <https://data.idnau.org/pid/nntt/WI2014-015> ;
    schema:startDate "2014-07-18"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Details of the agreement

Commencement

The Agreement was registered with the National Native Title Tribunal (NNTT) on 21 October 2014. However, the Agreement commences operative effect from 18 July 2014. No end date is specified.

Native Title Provisions

The Extract notes that the Agreement does not include any statements mentioned in subsection 24EB(1) or 24EBA(1) or (4) of the Native Title Act.

Background to the ILUA

Native Title in the ILUA Area

The Agreement Area is described as Pastoral Lease H649773 (Yeeda) - (Crown Lease H649773) within the external boundary of Native Title Determination application Nyikina and Mangal(WC1999/025; WAD6099/98)

A Consent Determination was made by the Federal Court on 29 May 2014 in relation to part of the application area (Watson on behalf of the Nyikina Mangala People v State of Western Australia (No 6) [2014] FCA 545)."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www.nntt.gov.au/searchRegApps/NativeTitleRegisters/Pages/ILUA_details.aspx?NNTT_Fileno=WI2014/015"^^xsd:anyURI .

