    schema:description """The Statement of Strategic Partnership between Apunipima Cape York Health Council and Catholic Health Australia committed parties to working in partnership to close the gap in Aboriginal and Torres Straight Islander health within Cape York. Catholic Health Australia will assist Apunipima in delivering health care to the people of Cape York, support Apunipima’s advocacy, and participate in workshops and community visits.

