        atns-sub:dc50c698-80b0-5ef4-bd95-928f2be8da05,
        atns-sub:ffe61b3b-8b29-5264-89ac-758a03928ea5,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:location "New South Wales and Victoria, Australia"@en ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=478> ;
    schema:name "Eastern Gas Pipeline Agreement"@en ;
    schema:startDate "1997-08-27"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Despite the agreement having been made in 1997, the way for payment was only cleared in 2004 due to a range of legal objections. A Victorian Supreme Court finding in November 2004 found there was no substance to the most recent objections to the establishment of a twin trust.

It is expected that the agreed (AUD) 4.3 million dollars will be distributed over the next 10 years to be spent on a range of educational and sporting scholarships, job creation and other projects."""@en .

