    schema:description "Under the Urandangie (Marmanya) Indigenous Land Use Agreement, native title is surrendered to the State of Queensland over an area of land, Lot 7 in the town of Urandangi, in west Queensland near the Northern Territory border. The agreement also enables a section of land to be used on Lot 8 in Urandangie for a road to access Lot 7."@en ;
