    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description "The Bar-Barrum Permit to Occupy Indigenous Land Use Agreement enables the State of Queensland to validly grant a Permit to Occupy (number 211254) over a parcel of land south west of Cairns (Lot 3 on AP3453, parish of Western, county of Hodgkinson). The grant of the permit will enable the native title holders of the area, the Bar-Barrum People, to enter onto the land and use it to exercise their native title rights, in line with the consent determination made in the Federal Court that native title exists in the area covered by this ILUA."@en ;
