    schema:text """Background: The Application for this determination was filed in December 2014. The judge congratulated the parties on achieving an agreement within a three year period. (What's new in Native Title, p. 10)

Details of judgement: This consent determination came into effect on 20 April 2018 when the Warlmanpa Warumugu Aboriginal Corporation became the prescribed body corporate."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www8.austlii.edu.au/cgi-bin/viewdoc/au/cases/cth/FCA/2017/867.html"^^xsd:anyURI .

