    schema:description "In accordance with the Land Use and Access Agreement between the Western Yalanji People, the State of Queensland and Noel A. Adam, the Western Yalanji, pursuant to Section 21 of the Native Title Act 1993, authorised certain acts which may affect their native title rights and interests in order to enable Adam to continue his mining activities within the determination area."@en ;
