idn-resource:dd2a32aa-a53f-526d-9866-e7d696b06c37 a atns:Entity,
        schema:CreativeWork ;
    atns:category atns-cat:13e77fec-44fd-554f-a075-ec60788eb1b1 ;
    atns:deleted false ;
    atns:eid "A007997"^^xsd:token ;
    atns:sourceEntityId "7997"^^xsd:token ;
    atns:subcategory atns-subcat:009cc2ae-06a8-5cd7-922a-c90a2c0cd3b2,
        atns-subcat:09f0a068-ce65-5c11-8dec-f081d1a81ec2 ;
    schema:additionalType cat-obj-types:Agreement ;
    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description """The Bandjalang Interim Licences Indigenous Land Use Agreement ('ILUA') was agreed, under the provisions of the Native Title Act 1993 (Cth), between the Minister administering the Crown Lands Act and Bandjalang Aboriginal Corporation Prescribed Bod Corporate Registered Native Title Body Corporate (RNTBC).

The agreement area covers about 682 sq km and is located north of Grafton, south of Casino and west of Evans Head.

The purpose of the agreement is to make provisions for the use of land that has previously been subject to a licence granted by the Crown Lands Minister, where the licence has been terminated and has not yet been reissued, for the five year period following the registration of the agreement.

The Native Title Representative Body for this area is NTSCORP limited."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:c74e76ef-701f-5784-8223-5fcd87a7641c,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=7997> ;
    schema:name "Bandjalang Interim Licences Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA)"@en ;
    schema:spatialCoverage <https://data.idnau.org/pid/nntt/NI2018-008> ;
    schema:startDate "2018-11-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Agreement area:

The agreement area covers about 682 sq km and is located north of Grafton, south of Casino and west of Evans Head. The Extract from the Register of Indigenous Land Use Agreements identifies the area subject to this ILUA, per Schedule A, Attachment A2 of the agreement, as all the land and waters within areas where native title had been determined to have exist within Bandjalang People #1 and Bandjalang People #2 consent determinations.

Termination:

This ILUA ceases on the 20 November 2023.

Native Title Provisions:

Future act provisions

The parties consent to the Crown Lands Minister re-issuing the remaining terminated licences to the former licensees for a period of up to five years from the date of the agreement is entered onto the Register of Indigenous Land Use Agreements.

The parties also consent to the former licensee using and occupying the land from the date this agreement is registered to the date that the terminated licence is validly re-issued under the Native Title At 1993 (Cth) or under this agreement. The former licensee cannot continue to use and occupy the land beyond five years of the date that this agreement is registered without having the licence re-issued.

The parties agree to the validation of the former licensee's use or occupation of the terminated licence land that occurred prior to the date this agreement was registered.Â

Where the procedures set out in Schedule C of the agreement are complied with, the parties consent to the doing of future acts that are covered by the Alternative Future Acts Regime (AFAR) as set out in Schedule C of the agreement (Schedule C is not included in the NNTT extract). The AFAR provisions may not operate beyond five years after the registration date of the agreement.

Native Title in the Agreement Area:

This agreement is located within the native title determination area of the Federal Court of Australia (FCA) proceeding Bandjalang People #1 v Attorney General of New South Wales [2013] FCA 1278. (FCA file no.: NSD6034/1998, NNTT file no.: NCD2013/001) and FCA proceeding Bandjalang People #2 v Attorney General of New South Wales [2013] FCA 1278. (FCA file no.: NSD6107/1998, NNTT file no.: NCD2013/002)."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www.nntt.gov.au/searchRegApps/NativeTitleRegisters/Pages/ILUA_details.aspx?NNTT_Fileno=NI2018/008"^^xsd:anyURI .

