    schema:description """Project: Rio Tinto Exploration
Summary: The Stokes Range Agreement is a comprehensive conjunctive exploration agreement providing for exploration access on Aboriginal freehold land. The Agreement includes liaison structure, heritage & cultural protection, community benefits, training, employment, and also provision for land rents, profit interest and regional development if mineral discovery and mine development occurs."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
