    schema:description """The Birchip Hospital Indigenous Land Use Agreement (the ILUA) provides the consent of the local native title group for a Crown Allotment of land to be granted to the East Wimmera Health Service for construction of a clinic (hospital). The site of the land was previously known as the Birchip Police Station.

The native title group agrees to surrender any native title rights and interests which may exist in the area of the ILUA."""@en ;
