    schema:description """The Nyikina Mangala and Shire of Derby-West Kimberley Native Title Negotiation Agreement establishes a framework for the negotiation of an Indigenous Land Use Agreement over the area of the Shire of Derby. The agreement also sets up a process to enable the development of other agreements addressing cultural matters and delivery of community services.

A full text copy of the agreement is available to view in pdf format by clicking on the Gallery link on the Agreement page or by clicking on the PDF link on the document page."""@en ;
