This is the right to possession, occupation, use, and enjoyment of the area, described in Schedule [INSERT SCHEDULE NAME/NUMBER], to the exclusion of all others.

The area/s where exclusive native title exists is/are described in [INSERT SCHEDULE NAME/NUMBER] as [INSERT AREA DESCRIPTION AS BRIEFLY AS POSSIBLE]

