In the case of conflict, the exercise of non-native title rights and interests will prevail over the non-exclusive native title

The [INSERT NAME] Aboriginal Corporation Registered Native Title Body Corporate (RNTBC) is the prescribed body corporate. It performs the functions required under the Native Title Act 1993 (Cth) and [INSERT acts as agent / OR holds the native title in trust] for the [INSERT THE NAME OF THE NATIVE TITLE HOLDERS].

Full text of the determination is available via the URL link above."""@en ;
