    schema:text "The consent determination arises from an application for determination of native title lodged on 18 June 1996. The original named applicants were Michealangelo Newie, Sam Kris, John Levi, John Loveman, Dick Peters and Steven Peters on behalf of the Gebaralgal. The sole respondent is the State of Queensland. The parties mediated the issues which arose from the initial application and the Court granted the orders sought without a full hearing of the determination application."@en ;
