    schema:additionalType cat-obj-types:Agreement ;
    schema:conditionsOfAccess <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/data-access-rights/open> ;
    schema:description """Kalkarindji Township Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA) is an Area Agreement between:

- Gurundji Aboriginal Corporation RNTBC;

- Ida Malyiki and Bernard Pontiari Japalyi;

- the Central Land Council; and

- the Northern Territory of Australia.

The purpose of this Agreement is to extinguish Native Title within the Agreement Area."""@en ;
    schema:isPartOf idn-resource:d23405b4-fc04-47e2-9e7a-9c5735ae3780 ;
    schema:keywords atns-sub:c74e76ef-701f-5784-8223-5fcd87a7641c,
        atns-sub:dbff1607-a2a3-5baf-995d-8c9bb0552665,
        "Demo" ;
    schema:mainEntityOfPage <https://database.atns.net.au/agreement.asp?EntityID=6714> ;
    schema:name "Kalkarindji Township Indigenous Land Use Agreement (ILUA)"@en ;
    schema:spatialCoverage <https://data.idnau.org/pid/nntt/DI2014-002> ;
    schema:startDate "2014-05-27"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:text """Commencement

This ILUA was registered with the Register of Indigenous Land Use Agreements on 21 November 2014.

The Extract specifies the start date as 27 May 2014, but does not specify an end date for the Agreement.

The Agreement commences on the Date of Execution. The Extract does not specify this Date. However, the Agreement is of legal effect upon being entered on the Register.

Native Title Provisions

The parties to the Agreement consent to the surrendering and extinguishment of Native Title to the Northern Territory of Part A of the Agreement Area.

Native Title in the ILUA Area

Kalkarindji and Daguragu are on the traditional homelands of the Gurindji people, and these communities are linked to the Malgnin, Mudpurra, Bilinara, Ngarinman and Warlpiri peoples through the historic Walkoff from Wave Hill Station, which was initially established on Gurindji traditional lands in 1883."""@en ;
    schema:url "http://www.nntt.gov.au/searchRegApps/NativeTitleRegisters/Pages/ILUA_details.aspx?NNTT_Fileno=DI2014/002"^^xsd:anyURI .

